Subject: [PATCH] Price changes: mark flagged rows as reviewed; healthy-margin
 filter

- "Mark as reviewed" on a flagged row (raise price? / selling at a loss)
  clears the warning and files it under a new "Reviewed" filter, with Undo.
  A new cost/price change to the same product clears the review again.
- Migration 0006 (already applied live): reviewed_at column; staff may set
  only that column, the history values stay read-only
- Products list status filter: "Healthy margin (10% or more)"

